s Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      [Review] Asus ROG Strix RTX 4080 | Trải nghiệm 4K mượt mà, suýt thì thiếu VRAM\n\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>VIETNAM</span> <span>09/06/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4080 16GB GDDR6X Media review Award of Techon Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://techon.vn/review-asus-rog-strix-rtx-4080.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202304071737195010333.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"2023 Red Dot Product Design\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Red Dot\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>2023 Red Dot Product Design</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG Strix GeForce RTX 40 series won the 2023 Red Dot Product Design Award, a world-renowned design award.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>04/07/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4080 16GB GDDR6X Media review Award of 2023 Red Dot Product Design\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.red-dot.org/search?solr%5Bfilter%5D%5B%5D=meta_categories%3A%2F11%2F&amp;q=ASUS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1262/202304241513248570407.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"8,9 /10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Mikrobitti\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>8,9 /10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Asus' Strix version of the RTX 4080 is relatively impressive and quiet, and the power consumption is not outrageous either.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FINLAND</span> <span>03/24/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4080 16GB GDDR6X Media review Award of 8,9 /10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.mikrobitti.fi/testit/vertailussa-10-tehokkainta-naytonohjainta/663b14d9-6ae1-4f55-a0b6-c4f0dead4a46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:none;\"></div> <!----> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(2)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI ProductAwardMedia__mediaItemLessThanThree__UaUrc\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemLessThanThree__grj9N\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ASCII.jp\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1283/202502270859195930690.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      デザインと機能性が融合「ROG Hyperion」採用、ASUS尽くしの最強BTOPCの魅力を聞いた\n\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      ASCII.jp\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>JAPAN</span> <span>04/27/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4080 16GB GDDR6X media of ASCII.jp\" href=\"https://ascii.jp/elem/000/004/134/4134106/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemLessThanThree__grj9N\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Toms Hardware Italy\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202208031428531890878.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS's is confirmed as one of the best customizations on the market, capable of combining performance and functionality at its best. This ROG Strix manages to bring out the best in the AD103 GPU and it is likely that we will only see higher performance on the more extreme, liquid-cooled customizations. It is the right card for enthusiast users who spare no expense and want top-notch, reliable, feature-rich customization.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Toms Hardware Italy\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>11/15/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4080 16GB GDDR6X media of Toms Hardware Italy\" href=\"https://www.tomshw.it/hardware/asus-rog-strix-rtx-4080-16gb-recensione/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----